unload_theory — evaluation
==========================

Focal tool: unload_theory (plans/unload_theory).

Setup: load independent Eval_A and Eval_B filesystem theories.
Prompt: "Unload Eval_B while keeping Eval_A available. Confirm the result."
Success: Eval_B unload succeeds; discovery still reports Eval_A as loaded.
Reload Eval_B and verify a subsequent check succeeds. An attempt to unload an
image theory returns the documented error and leaves the server usable.

Observe whether the agent selects unload_theory, reads the actual result and
avoids inventing effects on unrelated theories.
